    },
    {
      "number": 157,
      "text": "From wherever you set out, turn your face towards the Sacred Mosque [i.e., Ka‘bah]. Wherever you are, turn your faces towards it, so that the people should not have any proof against you[64], except for the wrongdoers among them. So do not fear them but fear Me, so that I may complete My favor upon you [all] and that you may be guided.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 2,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَقَرَةِ",
